                <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pages 01-16 contain the journey and screen wireframes. Click linked navigation shapes or use the draw.io page tabs.&lt;br&gt;White fields = portal inputs; grey fields = source/read-only. Asterisks mark proposed required inputs. Square boxes = checkboxes; &#39;( )&#39; = radio options.&lt;br&gt;Notes below each screen are design annotations, not proposed in-app tutorial text. All sample names/values are illustrative.&lt;br&gt;Source-address/contact fields depend on D-03 / OQ-3a. Region and policy precedence depend on D-18. EN wireframes require EN/ES implementation." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;fontColor=#58595B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="770" width="1360" height="160" as="geometry"/>
