                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" value="All routes enforce API permissions and tenant scope. Missing/expired/revoked invites stay on recovery paths (15).&lt;br&gt;Link re-evaluation is asynchronous; an active login is not a promise that every imported shipment is already available.&lt;br&gt;No source organisation creation, password form, automatic contact invitation or arbitrary customer switching is introduced." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=16;fontColor=#58595B;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
