                <mxCell id="note" value="DESIGN NOTES | Three consecutive states shown together. Multiple servicing branches per account remain a decision, not an assumed selector.&lt;br&gt;Second-person mapping approval is conditional. If adopted, gate linkage/readiness and show pending approval; never show it as universally required.&lt;br&gt;Creation is retry-safe; email failure does not duplicate the customer. Roles/domains and source linkage validated again at final submit.&lt;br&gt;External ID provisioning sequence remains an Identity-team gate; portal email invitation alone does not create the Microsoft account." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;fontColor=#58595B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
