                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" value="SCREENSHOTS 2-3 | Overview and Linked organisations are separate production tabs; combined here to show their field inventories.&lt;br&gt;Edit customer updates portal fields only; it does not rerun onboarding or edit CW1. Existing links remain intact unless explicitly changed.&lt;br&gt;Replace Add a branch / CW1 branch record with Link organisation / CW1 organisation. No mandatory one-legal-entity-per-group filter without sign-off.&lt;br&gt;Move impersonation/suspension under More actions with guards (15). Remove repeated How access works section; retain contextual status, not architecture lessons.&lt;br&gt;A red badge must have an accessible meaning (for example Pending link requests), not an unexplained organisation count." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;fontColor=#58595B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
