                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="310" width="1360" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="row3" value="[Invited colleague]             Standard                      Not applicable           Invited              Expires [date]                    Resend / Revoke" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E5;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=16;align=left;spacingLeft=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="1360" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pager" value="[Result count] users / invitations                                         Previous     [Page]     Next" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=16;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="1360" height="35" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="inviteForm" value="&lt;b&gt;Invite Customer Admin | Dialog&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Customer: [fixed, authorised group]&lt;br&gt;Display name *: [input]&lt;br&gt;Company email *: [input]&lt;br&gt;Locale *: [English / Spanish]&lt;br&gt;Role: Customer Admin [fixed]&lt;br&gt;Expiry: [configured duration, read-only]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Domain mismatch: blocked unless internal exception grant.&lt;br&gt;Exception reason * shown only for that authorised path.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cancel                                Send invitation" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AA272F;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="650" height="340" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="drawer" value="&lt;b&gt;User detail | Drawer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Name / email / customer / locale&lt;br&gt;Assigned role presets + effective module access&lt;br&gt;Financial restriction: [all authorised / single linked office]&lt;br&gt;Identity binding: [linked / pending, no credential fields]&lt;br&gt;Last sign-in / invited by / expiry / acceptance date&lt;br&gt;Audit history; original and effective actor for support&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actions by permission: deactivate / reactivate / resend / revoke&lt;br&gt;Customer Admin edits permitted role presets in 13.&lt;br&gt;No last-admin removal; no automatic finance grant." style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F5F5F3;strokeColor=#E5E5E5;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="730" y="520" width="670" height="340" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" value="SCREENSHOT 4 | The basic invitation ownership is correct. Add the financial-office scope and a clear detail view; identity jargon can be secondary.&lt;br&gt;The first admin is invited by Noatum; ordinary colleagues are invited by their Customer Admin. Additional admin invitation follows approved grants.&lt;br&gt;Last-admin safety and reason/confirmation must exist even though screenshots cannot prove backend checks. Deactivation denies the next API request.&lt;br&gt;Do not claim Microsoft sessions were revoked unless that operation exists; label portal access as deactivated. Invitation delivery differs from acceptance.&lt;br&gt;Rows/forms are design states; no runtime control is implemented here. Customer-user self-service flow is on 13." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;fontColor=#58595B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="915" width="1360" height="165" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
