                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="850" width="1360" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" value="DESIGN NOTES | Two separate tabs. Parent hierarchy is a portal visibility decision, not an automatic copy of CW1 parent_org_code.&lt;br&gt;Children cannot see parent/sibling data. Finance permission and addressee rules remain independent. No arbitrary multi-group user membership.&lt;br&gt;Only authorised actors can edit hierarchy; show impact and retain audit. No speculative hierarchy editor beyond two levels.&lt;br&gt;Screenshots do not reveal current Hierarchy/Audit contents; this page supplies proposed designs, not findings of missing backend functionality." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Mulish;fontSize=17;fontColor=#58595B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="965" width="1360" height="120" as="geometry"/>
